    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>THE NEW RPG OF ADVENTURE AND SURVIVAL IN A WILD, MYTHICAL WORLD</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dare to cross the polar wall, adventurer, and step into a land forgotten by time. The island of Elysium awaits \u2014 a living world where every step brings discovery, every creature hides a secret, and every decision leaves its mark.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2022 An open world filled with mystery and ancient ruins</strong><br>Explore a vast, ever-changing land of haunted forests, crumbling temples, and places where nature has reclaimed its throne. Along your journey, you'll uncover fragments of a story lost to wind and stone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2022 Survival, crafting, and blacksmithing as the core of your progress</strong><br>Gather resources, build tools, and forge your own weapons at the smithy. Every piece of gear you craft carries unique traits that shape your playstyle. Will you fight as a hardened warrior, move like an agile rogue, or strike with magic? You can even mix gear types to create your own class.<br>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3760690/extras/315a53d1a8d72ebfa3efc58b54da3311.poster.avif?t=1754005383\" width=550 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3760690/extras/315a53d1a8d72ebfa3efc58b54da3311.webm?t=1754005383\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3760690/extras/315a53d1a8d72ebfa3efc58b54da3311.mp4?t=1754005383\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2022 Strategic combat built on training and adaptation</strong><br>Victory doesn\u2019t rely on reflexes, but on preparation. Your character fights autonomously, but their effectiveness depends on how well you've trained with each weapon type. Understanding each enemy\u2019s strengths, weaknesses, and elemental affinities is key to survival. Sharpen your mind, refine your technique, and let your preparation speak on the battlefield.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3760690/extras/b9c5688c8f854040a79a77b020165d3a.poster.avif?t=1754005383\" width=550 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3760690/extras/b9c5688c8f854040a79a77b020165d3a.webm?t=1754005383\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3760690/extras/b9c5688c8f854040a79a77b020165d3a.mp4?t=1754005383\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3760690/extras/33bfbd38d0c76621bbbd08e5bd18b686.poster.avif?t=1754005383\" width=300 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3760690/extras/33bfbd38d0c76621bbbd08e5bd18b686.webm?t=1754005383\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3760690/extras/33bfbd38d0c76621bbbd08e5bd18b686.mp4?t=1754005383\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3760690/extras/2b83244bbea07fc2ffab3f323aaeacc4.poster.avif?t=1754005383\" width=300 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3760690/extras/2b83244bbea07fc2ffab3f323aaeacc4.webm?t=1754005383\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3760690/extras/2b83244bbea07fc2ffab3f323aaeacc4.mp4?t=1754005383\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2022 Freedom to forge your own path</strong><br>Develop your character your way \u2014 from a stealthy hunter to a brute-force warrior or a wise conjurer. Your choices, allies, and actions will shape your destiny.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3760690/extras/ff76bd8f5be5e150dcfb64bf49952289.poster.avif?t=1754005383\" width=300 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3760690/extras/ff76bd8f5be5e150dcfb64bf49952289.webm?t=1754005383\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3760690/extras/ff76bd8f5be5e150dcfb64bf49952289.mp4?t=1754005383\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3760690/extras/1814766a4062632c8705375fd97c24e3.poster.avif?t=1754005383\" width=300 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3760690/extras/1814766a4062632c8705375fd97c24e3.webm?t=1754005383\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3760690/extras/1814766a4062632c8705375fd97c24e3.mp4?t=1754005383\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2022 A fragmented narrative woven through myth and legend</strong><br>In Elysium, every ruin whispers a secret, and every encounter reveals echoes of long-lost civilizations \u2014 perhaps more than one. The story isn\u2019t told to you; you uncover it yourself, piece by piece, as you explore what remains of a world that once was.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Forge your legend. Survive the wild. Discover the forgotten.</strong><br>This is not just your journey\u2026 it\u2019s the story you\u2019ll leave behind.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>THE NEW RPG OF ADVENTURE AND SURVIVAL IN A WILD, MYTHICAL WORLD</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dare to cross the polar wall, adventurer, and step into a land forgotten by time. The island of Elysium awaits \u2014 a living world where every step brings discovery, every creature hides a secret, and every decision leaves its mark.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2022 An open world filled with mystery and ancient ruins</strong><br>Explore a vast, ever-changing land of haunted forests, crumbling temples, and places where nature has reclaimed its throne. Along your journey, you'll uncover fragments of a story lost to wind and stone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2022 Survival, crafting, and blacksmithing as the core of your progress</strong><br>Gather resources, build tools, and forge your own weapons at the smithy. Every piece of gear you craft carries unique traits that shape your playstyle. Will you fight as a hardened warrior, move like an agile rogue, or strike with magic? You can even mix gear types to create your own class.<br>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3760690/extras/315a53d1a8d72ebfa3efc58b54da3311.poster.avif?t=1754005383\" width=550 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3760690/extras/315a53d1a8d72ebfa3efc58b54da3311.webm?t=1754005383\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3760690/extras/315a53d1a8d72ebfa3efc58b54da3311.mp4?t=1754005383\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2022 Strategic combat built on training and adaptation</strong><br>Victory doesn\u2019t rely on reflexes, but on preparation. Your character fights autonomously, but their effectiveness depends on how well you've trained with each weapon type. Understanding each enemy\u2019s strengths, weaknesses, and elemental affinities is key to survival. Sharpen your mind, refine your technique, and let your preparation speak on the battlefield.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3760690/extras/b9c5688c8f854040a79a77b020165d3a.poster.avif?t=1754005383\" width=550 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3760690/extras/b9c5688c8f854040a79a77b020165d3a.webm?t=1754005383\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3760690/extras/b9c5688c8f854040a79a77b020165d3a.mp4?t=1754005383\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3760690/extras/33bfbd38d0c76621bbbd08e5bd18b686.poster.avif?t=1754005383\" width=300 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3760690/extras/33bfbd38d0c76621bbbd08e5bd18b686.webm?t=1754005383\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3760690/extras/33bfbd38d0c76621bbbd08e5bd18b686.mp4?t=1754005383\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3760690/extras/2b83244bbea07fc2ffab3f323aaeacc4.poster.avif?t=1754005383\" width=300 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3760690/extras/2b83244bbea07fc2ffab3f323aaeacc4.webm?t=1754005383\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3760690/extras/2b83244bbea07fc2ffab3f323aaeacc4.mp4?t=1754005383\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2022 Freedom to forge your own path</strong><br>Develop your character your way \u2014 from a stealthy hunter to a brute-force warrior or a wise conjurer. Your choices, allies, and actions will shape your destiny.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3760690/extras/ff76bd8f5be5e150dcfb64bf49952289.poster.avif?t=1754005383\" width=300 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3760690/extras/ff76bd8f5be5e150dcfb64bf49952289.webm?t=1754005383\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3760690/extras/ff76bd8f5be5e150dcfb64bf49952289.mp4?t=1754005383\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3760690/extras/1814766a4062632c8705375fd97c24e3.poster.avif?t=1754005383\" width=300 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3760690/extras/1814766a4062632c8705375fd97c24e3.webm?t=1754005383\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3760690/extras/1814766a4062632c8705375fd97c24e3.mp4?t=1754005383\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2022 A fragmented narrative woven through myth and legend</strong><br>In Elysium, every ruin whispers a secret, and every encounter reveals echoes of long-lost civilizations \u2014 perhaps more than one. The story isn\u2019t told to you; you uncover it yourself, piece by piece, as you explore what remains of a world that once was.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Forge your legend. Survive the wild. Discover the forgotten.</strong><br>This is not just your journey\u2026 it\u2019s the story you\u2019ll leave behind.</p>",
